# Media and video

Media components span WC (canonical CE), framework CE-hosts, and shared math in `@rosettadash/core`.

## Component map

| Component | Taxonomy | Pattern | Notes |
|-----------|----------|---------|-------|
| `video-source` | `visual.media.video-source` | manual CE | File pick, metadata events |
| `equirect-viewport` | `visual.media.equirect-viewport` | manual CE | Legacy 2:1 flat-crop on frame |
| `youtube-embed` | `visual.media.youtube-embed` | manual CE | iframe embed |
| `live-capture` | `visual.media.live-capture` | native | getUserMedia |
| `wasm/media` | `visual.wasm.media` | manual CE | ffmpeg.wasm pipeline |
| `equirect-sphere-viewport` | — | hand (React/Angular only) | Authoring 360° sphere |
| `flat-video-viewport` | — | hand (React/Angular only) | Authoring flat 2D crop |

Grandfathered extras must gain manifest entries or be removed — do not add more.

## Builder / export pipeline

Chain (`docs/30-equirect-media-pipeline.md`):

```
video-source.videoFile → wasm.media.inputFile
equirect-viewport.cropRegion → wasm.media.cropRegion
```

Filter strings from **`@rosettadash/core`** — `buildEquirectFlatCropFilter`, `buildEquirectExtractFilter`, `DEFAULT_EQUIRECT_*`. Never duplicate filter math in WC or frameworks.

## WC CE rules

- Shadow DOM for media CEs
- `setProperty('inputFile', file)`, `setProperty('cropRegion', region)`, etc.
- Events: `video-file`, `metadata`, `crop-region` — kebab-case, typed detail
- Revoke object URLs on disconnect

## Framework CE-hosts

Thin wrappers only — same attrs/events as WC (`11-component-public-contract.mdc`).

## Browser bundle

`@rosettadash/web-components/browser/media` — esbuild ESM for vanilla/no-build apps. Rebuild via `scripts/bundle-browser-media.mjs` when API changes.

## App-level headers (proof apps / wasm)

For SharedArrayBuffer + YouTube embeds together:

- `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin`
- `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless`
- Serve `@ffmpeg/core` same-origin

Document in app README — **not** inside atom components.

## Autoplay and captions

- Autoplay only with `muted` unless user gesture documented
- Provide `<track kind="captions">` support where `<video>` is rendered — WCAG 2.2 (`13-accessibility.mdc`)
- Processing progress: `aria-live="polite"`

## SSR

All media components are **client-only** with SSR placeholder (`16-ssr-and-runtime-environment.mdc`).

